  "meta": {
    "id": "defence-in-depth",
    "title": "No single control is the defence",
    "kind": "plan",
    "audience": "executive",
    "redaction": "none",
    "scene": "bowtie",
    "source": {
      "kind": "illustrative"
    },
    "_note": "Invented example for the custom scene seam (barriers between threats and consequences, a bow-tie). Every record is illustrative; which threats get through, and the counts, are computed from the barriers and additions by the scene. The order of the barriers array is the order along a path: from a threat toward the event, and from the event toward a consequence."
  },
